    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/763a239eb00c651e92ac88b686697559.avif?t=1749094290\" width=600 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the vastness of space, a mysterious signal echoes from a planet in the Federated Feline System. Judy, a fearless space bounty hunter, is sent to investigate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/703e74c6e556f998a7745b495882b4ab.poster.avif?t=1749094290\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/703e74c6e556f998a7745b495882b4ab.webm?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/703e74c6e556f998a7745b495882b4ab.mp4?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore richly illustrated environments filled with hidden paths \u2014 abandoned temples, frozen labs, and fungal forests await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/a4bd04ce682666852826585010f42b8b.poster.avif?t=1749094290\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/a4bd04ce682666852826585010f42b8b.webm?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/a4bd04ce682666852826585010f42b8b.mp4?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mysterious story lurking beneath the surface!<br>Reveal secrets and access new areas with powerful gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/18b47abd788f63dc98ae401d3ba46605.poster.avif?t=1749094290\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/18b47abd788f63dc98ae401d3ba46605.webm?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/18b47abd788f63dc98ae401d3ba46605.mp4?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an exclusive, atmospheric soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun in the biggest Devcats game yet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to uncover what happened on A Planet Full of Cats?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/763a239eb00c651e92ac88b686697559.avif?t=1749094290\" width=600 height=192 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep in the vastness of space, a mysterious signal echoes from a planet in the Federated Feline System. Judy, a fearless space bounty hunter, is sent to investigate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/703e74c6e556f998a7745b495882b4ab.poster.avif?t=1749094290\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/703e74c6e556f998a7745b495882b4ab.webm?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/703e74c6e556f998a7745b495882b4ab.mp4?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore richly illustrated environments filled with hidden paths \u2014 abandoned temples, frozen labs, and fungal forests await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/a4bd04ce682666852826585010f42b8b.poster.avif?t=1749094290\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/a4bd04ce682666852826585010f42b8b.webm?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/a4bd04ce682666852826585010f42b8b.mp4?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the mysterious story lurking beneath the surface!<br>Reveal secrets and access new areas with powerful gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/18b47abd788f63dc98ae401d3ba46605.poster.avif?t=1749094290\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/18b47abd788f63dc98ae401d3ba46605.webm?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355100/extras/18b47abd788f63dc98ae401d3ba46605.mp4?t=1749094290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy an exclusive, atmospheric soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun in the biggest Devcats game yet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you brave enough to uncover what happened on A Planet Full of Cats?</p>",
